---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const page = {
  title: "Privacy Policy",
  h1: "Privacy Policy",
};
const hreflang = "<link rel='alternate' hreflang='en' href='https://cholinebio.com/privacy-policy/'/><link rel='alternate' hreflang='x-default' href='https://cholinebio.com/privacy-policy/'/><link rel='alternate' hreflang='ar' href='https://cholinebio.com/ar/%d8%b3%d9%8a%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%a9-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%ae%d8%b5%d9%88%d8%b5%d9%8a%d8%a9/'/><link rel='alternate' hreflang='fr' href='https://cholinebio.com/fr/politique-de-confidentialite/'/><link rel='alternate' hreflang='tr' href='https://cholinebio.com/tr/gizlilik-politikasi/'/><link rel='alternate' hreflang='es' href='https://cholinebio.com/es/politica-de-privacidad/'/><link rel='alternate' hreflang='de' href='https://cholinebio.com/de/datenschutzbestimmungen/'/><link rel='alternate' hreflang='zh' href='https://cholinebio.com/zh/%e9%9a%90%e7%a7%81%e6%94%bf%e7%ad%96/'/><link rel='alternate' hreflang='pt' href='https://cholinebio.com/pt/politica-de-privacidade/'/>";
---
<BaseLayout title={page.title} ogType="website" description="Welcome to CholineBio (“we,” “our,” “us”). We are committed to protecting your personal information and ensuring transparency regarding how we collect,..." canonical="/privacy-policy/" hreflang={hreflang}>
  <article class="page-content">
    <h1 class="page-title">{page.h1}</h1>
    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<header class="entry-header page-title title-align-inherit title-tablet-align-inherit title-mobile-align-inherit"><h1 class="entry-title">Privacy Policy</h1><nav id="kadence-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumbs"  class="kadence-breadcrumbs"><div class="kadence-breadcrumb-container"><span><a href="/" itemprop="url" class="kadence-bc-home" ><span>Home</span></a></span> <span class="bc-delimiter">/</span> <span class="kadence-bread-current">Privacy Policy</span></div></nav></header><div class="entry-content single-content"><p data-start="173" data-end="211"><strong data-start="173" data-end="211">Effective Date: September 22, 2025</strong></p><p data-start="213" data-end="476">Welcome to <strong data-start="224" data-end="238">CholineBio</strong> (“we,” “our,” “us”). We are committed to protecting your personal information and ensuring transparency regarding how we collect, use, store, and share data when you visit <strong data-start="411" data-end="438"><a class="decorated-link" href="/" target="_new" rel="noopener" data-start="413" data-end="436">/</a></strong> or engage with our business services.</p><hr data-start="478" data-end="481" /><h1 data-start="483" data-end="507"><strong data-start="485" data-end="507">1. Data Controller</strong></h1><p data-start="508" data-end="536">This website is operated by:</p><p data-start="538" data-end="658"><strong data-start="538" data-end="555">Company Name:</strong> Dinweys (Export Sales Company)<br data-start="586" data-end="589" /><strong data-start="589" data-end="601">Website:</strong> <a class="decorated-link" href="" target="_new" rel="noopener" data-start="602" data-end="624"></a><br data-start="624" data-end="627" /><strong data-start="627" data-end="637">Email:</strong> <a class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" rel="noopener" data-start="638" data-end="656"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="ee838f9c9a8780ae8a8780998b979dc08d8183">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p><p data-start="660" data-end="757">If you are located in the EU/EEA, Dinweys acts as the <strong data-start="714" data-end="733">data controller</strong> for your personal data.</p><hr data-start="759" data-end="762" /><h1 data-start="764" data-end="795"><strong data-start="766" data-end="795">2. Information We Collect</strong></h1><p data-start="796" data-end="846">We may collect the following types of information:</p><h3 data-start="848" data-end="882"><strong data-start="852" data-end="882">A. Information You Provide</strong></h3><p data-start="883" data-end="900">Examples include:</p><ul data-start="902" data-end="1090"><li data-start="902" data-end="910"><p data-start="904" data-end="910">Name</p></li><li data-start="911" data-end="928"><p data-start="913" data-end="928">Email address</p></li><li data-start="929" data-end="945"><p data-start="931" data-end="945">Phone number</p></li><li data-start="946" data-end="979"><p data-start="948" data-end="979">Company name and job position</p></li><li data-start="980" data-end="991"><p data-start="982" data-end="991">Address</p></li><li data-start="992" data-end="1043"><p data-start="994" data-end="1043">Business inquiries, RFQs, order-related details</p></li><li data-start="1044" data-end="1090"><p data-start="1046" data-end="1090">Login credentials (if you create an account)</p></li></ul><h3 data-start="1092" data-end="1131"><strong data-start="1096" data-end="1131">B. Automatically Collected Data</strong></h3><p data-start="1132" data-end="1178">Collected through cookies and analytics tools:</p><ul data-start="1180" data-end="1345"><li data-start="1180" data-end="1194"><p data-start="1182" data-end="1194">IP address</p></li><li data-start="1195" data-end="1232"><p data-start="1197" data-end="1232">Browser type and operating system</p></li><li data-start="1233" data-end="1255"><p data-start="1235" data-end="1255">Device information</p></li><li data-start="1256" data-end="1287"><p data-start="1258" data-end="1287">Pages viewed and time spent</p></li><li data-start="1288" data-end="1306"><p data-start="1290" data-end="1306">Referring URLs</p></li><li data-start="1307" data-end="1345"><p data-start="1309" data-end="1345">General usage and interaction data</p></li></ul><h3 data-start="1347" data-end="1388"><strong data-start="1351" data-end="1388">C. Information from Third Parties</strong></h3><p data-start="1389" data-end="1421">We may receive information from:</p><ul data-start="1423" data-end="1583"><li data-start="1423" data-end="1499"><p data-start="1425" data-end="1499">B2B marketplaces (e.g., Alibaba, Made-in-China), if you contact us there</p></li><li data-start="1500" data-end="1526"><p data-start="1502" data-end="1526">Social media platforms</p></li><li data-start="1527" data-end="1583"><p data-start="1529" data-end="1583">Logistics or payment service providers you authorize</p></li></ul><hr data-start="1585" data-end="1588" /><h1 data-start="1590" data-end="1626"><strong data-start="1592" data-end="1626">3. How We Use Your Information</strong></h1><p data-start="1627" data-end="1659">We may use your information for:</p><ul data-start="1661" data-end="2004"><li data-start="1661" data-end="1725"><p data-start="1663" data-end="1725">Responding to RFQs, inquiries, and customer service requests</p></li><li data-start="1726" data-end="1770"><p data-start="1728" data-end="1770">Processing orders and providing services</p></li><li data-start="1771" data-end="1826"><p data-start="1773" data-end="1826">Improving website functionality and user experience</p></li><li data-start="1827" data-end="1923"><p data-start="1829" data-end="1923">Sending updates, business information, or marketing communications (where legally permitted)</p></li><li data-start="1924" data-end="1967"><p data-start="1926" data-end="1967">Verifying identity and preventing fraud</p></li><li data-start="1968" data-end="2004"><p data-start="1970" data-end="2004">Complying with legal obligations</p></li></ul><p data-start="2006" data-end="2115">We always process data based on a lawful basis (e.g., legitimate interest, consent, or contract performance).</p><hr data-start="2117" data-end="2120" /><h1 data-start="2122" data-end="2155"><strong data-start="2124" data-end="2155">4. Sharing Your Information</strong></h1><p data-start="2156" data-end="2248">We do <strong data-start="2162" data-end="2169">not</strong> sell your personal data. We may share information only in the following cases:</p><ul data-start="2250" data-end="2510"><li data-start="2250" data-end="2355"><p data-start="2252" data-end="2355"><strong data-start="2252" data-end="2273">Service Providers</strong> (hosting providers, IT security, logistics, email service providers, analytics)</p></li><li data-start="2356" data-end="2446"><p data-start="2358" data-end="2446"><strong data-start="2358" data-end="2378">Legal Compliance</strong> (government requests, legal proceedings, regulatory requirements)</p></li><li data-start="2447" data-end="2510"><p data-start="2449" data-end="2510"><strong data-start="2449" data-end="2471">Business Transfers</strong> (merger, acquisition, restructuring)</p></li></ul><p data-start="2512" data-end="2604">All service providers are required to protect your information under contractual agreements.</p><hr data-start="2606" data-end="2609" /><h1 data-start="2611" data-end="2651"><strong data-start="2613" data-end="2651">5. Cookies &amp; Tracking Technologies</strong></h1><p data-start="2652" data-end="2695">We use cookies and related technologies to:</p><ul data-start="2697" data-end="2850"><li data-start="2697" data-end="2728"><p data-start="2699" data-end="2728">Improve website performance</p></li><li data-start="2729" data-end="2763"><p data-start="2731" data-end="2763">Save your browsing preferences</p></li><li data-start="2764" data-end="2802"><p data-start="2766" data-end="2802">Analyze traffic and user behaviors</p></li><li data-start="2803" data-end="2850"><p data-start="2805" data-end="2850">Support marketing and remarketing campaigns</p></li></ul><p data-start="2852" data-end="2947">You may disable cookies via your browser settings, but some features may not function properly.</p><p data-start="2949" data-end="3002">A full <strong data-start="2956" data-end="2973">Cookie Policy</strong> can also be added if needed.</p><hr data-start="3004" data-end="3007" /><h1 data-start="3009" data-end="3031"><strong data-start="3011" data-end="3031">6. Data Security</strong></h1><p data-start="3032" data-end="3105">We implement reasonable technical and organizational measures, including:</p><ul data-start="3107" data-end="3256"><li data-start="3107" data-end="3131"><p data-start="3109" data-end="3131">SSL/HTTPS encryption</p></li><li data-start="3132" data-end="3173"><p data-start="3134" data-end="3173">Limited access control to stored data</p></li><li data-start="3174" data-end="3222"><p data-start="3176" data-end="3222">Secure hosting and regular system monitoring</p></li><li data-start="3223" data-end="3256"><p data-start="3225" data-end="3256">Periodic security assessments</p></li></ul><p data-start="3258" data-end="3346">While we strive to protect your data, no method of internet transmission is 100% secure.</p><hr data-start="3348" data-end="3351" /><h1 data-start="3353" data-end="3376"><strong data-start="3355" data-end="3376">7. Data Retention</strong></h1><p data-start="3377" data-end="3442">We retain personal data only for as long as necessary to fulfill:</p><ul data-start="3444" data-end="3549"><li data-start="3444" data-end="3465"><p data-start="3446" data-end="3465">Business purposes</p></li><li data-start="3466" data-end="3486"><p data-start="3468" data-end="3486">Customer support</p></li><li data-start="3487" data-end="3511"><p data-start="3489" data-end="3511">Contract obligations</p></li><li data-start="3512" data-end="3549"><p data-start="3514" data-end="3549">Legal and regulatory requirements</p></li></ul><p data-start="3551" data-end="3603">Afterward, we delete or anonymize the data securely.</p><hr data-start="3605" data-end="3608" /><h1 data-start="3610" data-end="3630"><strong data-start="3612" data-end="3630">8. Your Rights</strong></h1><p data-start="3631" data-end="3708">Depending on your jurisdiction (GDPR, CCPA, etc.), you may have the right to:</p><ul data-start="3710" data-end="3944"><li data-start="3710" data-end="3746"><p data-start="3712" data-end="3746">Access your personal information</p></li><li data-start="3747" data-end="3778"><p data-start="3749" data-end="3778">Correct or update your data</p></li><li data-start="3779" data-end="3825"><p data-start="3781" data-end="3825">Request deletion (“right to be forgotten”)</p></li><li data-start="3826" data-end="3862"><p data-start="3828" data-end="3862">Restrict or object to processing</p></li><li data-start="3863" data-end="3883"><p data-start="3865" data-end="3883">Withdraw consent</p></li><li data-start="3884" data-end="3904"><p data-start="3886" data-end="3904">Data portability</p></li><li data-start="3905" data-end="3944"><p data-start="3907" data-end="3944">Opt out of marketing communications</p></li></ul><p data-start="3946" data-end="3999">To exercise these rights:<br data-start="3971" data-end="3974" />📧 <strong data-start="3977" data-end="3999"><a class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" rel="noopener" data-start="3979" data-end="3997"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="dcb1bdaea8b5b29cb8b5b2abb9a5aff2bfb3b1">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></strong></p><hr data-start="4001" data-end="4004" /><h1 data-start="4006" data-end="4033"><strong data-start="4008" data-end="4033">9. Children’s Privacy</strong></h1><p data-start="4034" data-end="4181">Our website and services are <strong data-start="4063" data-end="4114">not intended for individuals under 13 years old</strong>.<br data-start="4115" data-end="4118" />We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p><hr data-start="4183" data-end="4186" /><h1 data-start="4188" data-end="4226"><strong data-start="4190" data-end="4226">10. International Data Transfers</strong></h1><p data-start="4227" data-end="4372">Since we serve global customers, your information may be processed outside your country.<br data-start="4315" data-end="4318" />We ensure appropriate safeguards are applied, such as:</p><ul data-start="4374" data-end="4519"><li data-start="4374" data-end="4413"><p data-start="4376" data-end="4413">Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs)</p></li><li data-start="4414" data-end="4459"><p data-start="4416" data-end="4459">Secure international hosting environments</p></li><li data-start="4460" data-end="4519"><p data-start="4462" data-end="4519">Compliance with international data-transfer regulations</p></li></ul><hr data-start="4521" data-end="4524" /><h1 data-start="4526" data-end="4558"><strong data-start="4528" data-end="4558">11. Changes to This Policy</strong></h1><p data-start="4559" data-end="4796">We may update this Privacy Policy when necessary for legal, technical, or business reasons.<br data-start="4650" data-end="4653" />Changes will be posted on this page with the updated <strong data-start="4706" data-end="4724">Effective Date</strong>. For major changes, we may also notify you via email or website alerts.</p><hr data-start="4798" data-end="4801" /><h1 data-start="4803" data-end="4823"><strong data-start="4805" data-end="4823">12. Contact Us</strong></h1><p data-start="4824" data-end="4908">If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or your data rights, please contact:</p><p data-start="4910" data-end="4977"><strong data-start="4910" data-end="4920">Email:</strong> <a class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" rel="noopener" data-start="4921" data-end="4939"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="4f222e3d3b26210f2b2621382a363c612c2022">[email&#160;protected]</span></a><br data-start="4939" data-end="4942" /><strong data-start="4942" data-end="4954">Website:</strong> <a class="decorated-link" href="" target="_new" rel="noopener" data-start="4955" data-end="4977"></a></p></div>`} />
  </article>

</BaseLayout>
